<title>GREECE: GREEK TRANSPORT MIN TO DISCUSS TELECOM LIBERALISATION.</title>
<headline>GREEK TRANSPORT MIN TO DISCUSS TELECOM LIBERALISATION.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport and Communications Minister Haralambos Kastanidis will discuss the liberalisation of telecommunications and its impact on Greece's economy at a luncheon on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The luncheon, organised by the Greek-Canadian Chamber of Commerce and will be held at the Grande Brettagne Hotel in Athens at 1100 GMT, the Chamber said in a statement.</p>
<p>The event will be attended by OTE, Olympic Airways, civil aviation officials and is sponsored by Nortel Northern Telecom, it added. --Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
